parameters, there and back:
number         Number 42                                  -> Number 42
negative       Number -42                                 -> Number -42
10^9           Number 1000000000                          -> Number 1000000000
10^18 - 1      Number 999999999999999999                  -> Number 999999999999999999
-(10^18 - 1)   Number -999999999999999999                 -> Number -999999999999999999
10^18          Number 1000000000000000000                 -> Number 1000000000  (DIFFERS)
30 digits      Number 123456789012345678901234567890      -> Number 123456789012  (DIFFERS)
-30 digits     Number -123456789012345678901234567890     -> Number -123456789012  (DIFFERS)
string         String "s"                                 -> String "s"
token          Token Test!tk                              -> Token Test!tk  (DIFFERS)
var            Var x                                      -> Var x
mnumber        MNumber n                                  -> MNumber n
mstring        MString m                                  -> MString m
mtoken         MToken t                                   -> MToken t
mlevel         MLevel {2 | 'i' | 'j}                      -> MLevel {2 | 'j | 'i'}  (DIFFERS)
list           [Number 1; String "a"]                     -> [Number 1; String "a"]
quote          Quote                                      -> Invalid_argument Mbterm.mbparameter_of_param: quote and shape parameters not supported
terms, there and back:
constant           Test!c
one subterm        Test!f{Test!c}
three subterms     Test!g{Test!c; Test!c; Test!c}
binding last       Test!lam{'x. 'x}
binding first      Test!h{'x, 'y. 'y; Test!c}
params             Test!p[3:n, "s":s]{Test!c}
two bindings       Test!k{'x. 'x; 'y. Test!c; Test!c}
